  "texts": {
    "preamble": "P Mallikarjun Malli vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 29 January, 2021 Author: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Bench: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy The Hon'Ble Sri Justice Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Criminal Petition No.440 Of 2021 Order:",
    "facts": "A case under Sections 328, 272 and 273 of the Indian Penal Code, 1860, under Section 59(1) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 and under Section 20(2) r/w 7(2) of the Cigarettes and Other Tobacco Products (Prohibition of Advertisement and Regulation of Trade and Commerce, Production, Supply and Distribution) Act, 2003 was registered against the petitioners in the above crime. The said case is now under investigation. This Court has earlier in Criminal Petition Nos.5421 of 2019 and batch, [LEAKAGE_MASK] the F.I.Rs registered for the similar offences based on identical facts.",
